[I] Perl URI module

[T] This package contains the URI.pm module with friends. The module
[T] implements the URI class. Objects of this class represent Uniform
[T] Resource Identifier (URI) references as specified in RFC 2396.
[T]
[T] URI objects can be used to access and manipulate the various components
[T] that make up these strings. There are also methods to combine URIs in
[T] various ways.

